      "text": "the normal ML workflow: \n    collect data--> train model--> evaluate mode --> Accuracy is 95% --> ????\nNOW the \"????\" is where the MLOps starts becoming important\n- a model being accurate in a notebook doesn't mean it's ready for production\n",
