      "text": "ML flow == experiment history\nExperiment == group related training runs\nRun == one training attempt\nparams == What I used ( input) \nmetrics == how good it was (result)\nArtifacts == files produced or attached to a specific run\nregistry == model version\nstaging == testing\nproduction == live\n",
